Explanation of the change:

- **Before**: `/'(?:''|[^'])+'`  
  The `+` quantifier means “one or more”, so `''` (empty smalltalk string) would never match.

- **After**: `/'(?:''|[^'])*'/`  
  The `*` quantifier means “zero or more”, so it now correctly matches `''` as well as any other quoted text.
